File name: FAERETRE.MP
Path description: Copperwood to Silverwood forests using the evil entrance.
Path starts: Copperwod Forest, faerie ring.
Path ends: Silverwood Forest, ancient tree.
Area of the game: Module 2
Level recommendation: N/A
Type of path: Path
File format: New
Monsters encountered: woodelf ranger, woodelf druid, woodelf guard, woodelf,
                      grizzly bear, faerie, unicorn.
Additional information:

This path uses the entrance to Silverwood for evil people. If you are evil,
you need to use this path, because the normal entrance will not let you in.
